{
  "$comment": "Lane 1 (plan 09 §5.1 items 3 and 7; §3.10): the calls this P1 Skill promises, in order, under EFF_TOOLSET=full, on fx-10h (Team 02; week 5; before the waiver run). The injured player is resolved from the user's roster: the player in IR (`report`), or the OUT player on the bench with an IR slot open (`ir_move`, ir-open). The beneficiaries priced by espn_analyze_waivers are the cascade's own (`$ids`). Format: skills/README.md#tool-sequences.",
